---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout lang="id" alternate="/research" title="Latar Riset — Jiilan Nashrulloh Tanjung" description="Latar riset Jiilan Nashrulloh Tanjung. Rigor-nya kebawa ke setiap build.">
  <section class="page">
    <header class="page-head reveal">
      <h1 class="page-title">Riset</h1>
      <p class="page-sub">Kehidupan masa lalu di akademia. Rigor-nya nempel terus. Kelihatan di setiap build yang saya ship.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="list">
      <article class="paper tint-lemon reveal">
        <div class="meta"><span>2025</span><span class="badge">Terbit</span></div>
        <h2>On the Computational Complexity of Real-Time Quantum Error Decoding</h2>
        <p class="authors">Jiilan N. Tanjung · arXiv, Quantum Computing</p>
        <p>Menganalisis overhead syndrome decoding pada surface code dan membuktikan lower bound latensi decoder dalam skala besar.</p>
        <div class="venue-note">Teks lengkap tersedia bila diminta.</div>
      </article>

      <article class="paper reveal">
        <div class="meta"><span>2024</span><span class="badge">Terbit</span></div>
        <h2>Consistency Envelopes: Honest Guarantees for Distributed Systems</h2>
        <p class="authors">Jiilan N. Tanjung · Workshop on Principles of Distributed Systems</p>
        <p>Cara formal mendokumentasikan kapan garansi safety berlaku dan bagaimana ia degrade saat partisi.</p>
        <div class="venue-note">Teks lengkap tersedia bila diminta.</div>
      </article>

      <article class="paper paper-peach reveal">
        <div class="meta"><span>2024</span><span class="badge badge-pre">Preprint</span></div>
        <h2>Geometry of Loss Landscapes in Over-Parameterized Networks</h2>
        <p class="authors">Jiilan N. Tanjung · arXiv, ML Theory</p>
        <p>Kurvatur Hessian, noise gradien dan generalisasi lewat lensa PAC-Bayesian.</p>
        <div class="venue-note">Teks lengkap tersedia bila diminta.</div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page { max-width: var(--page-width); margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-3) var(--space-8); }
  .page-head { text-align: center; }
  .page-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: var(--text-4xl); letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.05; }
  .page-sub { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--text-lg); margin: 10px auto 0; max-width: 56ch; }
  .list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin: var(--space-3) auto 0; max-width: 860px; }
  .paper {
    background: var(--color-paper-2); border: 2px solid var(--color-ink);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card); padding: var(--space-3);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
  }
  .tint-lemon { background: var(--color-lemon); }
  .paper-peach { background: var(--color-peach); }
  .paper h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-xl); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.25; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .authors { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--color-muted); }
  .meta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: 600; }
  .badge {
    background: var(--color-mint); color: var(--color-ink);
    border: 2px solid currentColor; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); padding: 2px 12px;
  }
  .badge-pre { background: var(--color-lemon); }
  .venue-note {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page { padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-2) var(--space-6); }
    .page-title { font-size: var(--text-3xl); }
  }
</style>
